        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, summer 2018, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, summer 2018, at plant
Technology shares determined based on data from ENTSO Transparency Platform. Only domestic electricity production is considered, electricity imports are neglected.;
UUID: 74233067-20b1-3e3c-91eb-a5a85b08e045
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in France in summer 2018.
Location: France
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_74233067-20b1-3e3c-91eb-a5a85b08e045.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
